Final Thoughts
Building the Causal Inference Application with an AI coding agent demonstrated the shift from an “AI-first” to an “agent-first” mindset. AI coding agents like Google Antigravity dramatically accelerate 0–1 development, but deep domain expertise is still crucial for accuracy and relevance. The true power lies not just in the code the agent generates, but in the human insight that guides its logic and interprets its output. This project, created during my career break, exemplifies resilience — leveraging cutting-edge AI and rigorous econometrics to build something new. This fusion is the skillset I am excited to bring to my next role.